# Firefox Firejail Profile Generator

## Overview

Firejail outlines some best practices for sandboxing web browsers, in particular the recommendation to create profiles for different use cases (social media browsing, e-commerce, banking, work, etc.) with commensurate sandboxing for each use case. 

There are known peculiarities with Firefox sandboxing that require certain tweaks, e.g. enabling certain addons or the use of hardware authentication tokens.


